          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: последствие",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "последствие (poslédstviye) — \"a consequence\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Это решение будет иметь серьёзные последствия. Éto reshéniye búdet imét seryóznyye poslédstviya. This decision will have serious consequences."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Neuter; mostly plural, последствия, and usually unpleasant."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "последствие (poslédstviye) is built from после \"after\" and след \"a track, a trail, a mark\" (EtymDB), with the suffix -ствие: what comes after, in the wake of an event."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
