          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "отражаться (otrazhátsya) — \"to affect, to tell on; to be reflected\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Усталость отражается на работе. Ustálost otrazháyetsya na rabóte. Tiredness tells on your work."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Imperfective; perfective отразиться. Отражаться на + prepositional — to affect. Literally to be reflected: в воде отражается луна."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "отражаться (otrazhátsya) is built from от- \"back\" and the root of разить \"to strike\" (EtymDB): light that strikes a surface and comes back is reflected, and so is a cause that comes back in its effects."
            }
          ]
        },
